WEBVTT

1
00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:03.500
In the previous verses,

2
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.166
after discussing Akshar Brahma,

3
00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:08.708
now in the next three verses Lord

4
00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:09.208
Lord Krishna

5
00:01:09.208 --> 00:01:12.625
describes Brahma’s life cycle.

6
00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:15.833
He explains in detail that in this life cycle

7
00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:17.333
this material world

8
00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:21.500
goes through repeated cycles
 of creation and destruction.

9
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.250
Lord Krishna here

10
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.458
is revealing the profound difference between

11
00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:27.541
the material and spiritual worlds.

12
00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:34.625
Lord Krishna explains

13
00:01:34.625 --> 00:01:36.291
that one day of Brahma

14
00:01:36.291 --> 00:01:40.791
and one night last for thousands of yugas.

15
00:01:40.791 --> 00:01:42.500
During Brahma’s day,

16
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:45.125
all living beings come into existence

17
00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:47.083
and engage in their respective

18
00:01:47.083 --> 00:01:48.666
activities.

19
00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:51.500
When his night arrives, these beings

20
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.625
dissolve back into the unseen state.

21
00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:55.750
This cycle of

22
00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:56.666
creation and dissolution

23
00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:59.875
continues throughout Brahma’s entire lifespan,

24
00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:03.750
which extends for countless earthly years.

25
00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.291
Although this vast span seems endless,

26
00:02:07.291 --> 00:02:10.250
from the perspective of eternity, Brahma’s life

27
00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:13.708
is fleeting like a bubble in the ocean.

28
00:02:13.708 --> 00:02:16.083
Lord Krishna further reveals

29
00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:18.833
that during Brahma’s day, living beings

30
00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:21.291
come into existence again and again,

31
00:02:21.291 --> 00:02:25.125
and when the night falls,
 they are dissolved once more.

32
00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:26.833
This cyclical process

33
00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:30.041
reveals the helplessness of living beings,

34
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:30.875
who are bound

35
00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:33.625
by the forces of time and nature.

36
00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:34.708
This continuous cycle

37
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:37.000
of creation and dissolution shows

38
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.666
that despite the material realm's vastness,

39
00:02:39.666 --> 00:02:43.125
all worlds, including the
 highest like Brahmaloka,

40
00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:44.750
are temporary.

41
00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:46.041
Lord Krishna

42
00:02:46.041 --> 00:02:48.208
describes this cosmic truth to awaken

43
00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:51.583
detachment within us.

44
00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:52.958
Recognizing the impermanence

45
00:02:52.958 --> 00:02:55.208
of material existence,

46
00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:57.000
we can aspire

47
00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.916
for what is eternal.

48
00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:00.583
Lord Krishna Himself,

49
00:03:00.583 --> 00:03:01.833
who remains ever-present beyond these

50
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:05.625
cycles of creation and destruction,

51
00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:08.333
only by focusing on Him

52
00:03:08.333 --> 00:03:10.250
can one reach the unchanging,

53
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.375
eternal destination.

54
00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:20.541
Have you ever thought

55
00:03:20.541 --> 00:03:24.625
how fleeting the emotions are
 that bring storms into your life?

56
00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:27.958
How fleeting they are?

57
00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:31.000
In this world, everything is temporary

58
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.416
and constantly

59
00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:37.458
passing through cycles 
of creation and dissolution.

60
00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:41.125
When you truly see this truth,

61
00:03:41.125 --> 00:03:44.083
you can begin to apply it to your own life

62
00:03:44.083 --> 00:03:47.541
and emotions.

63
00:03:47.541 --> 00:03:48.750
The joys

64
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.916
and sorrows you experience now

65
00:03:51.916 --> 00:03:54.916
may affect you deeply.

66
00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:57.500
But when you see them through this cycle

67
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.083
of creation and dissolution,

68
00:04:00.083 --> 00:04:03.041
their intensity

69
00:04:03.041 --> 00:04:05.541
begins to fade.

70
00:04:05.541 --> 00:04:08.041
Think about the emotions

71
00:04:08.041 --> 00:04:12.166
you go through, whether they bring

72
00:04:12.166 --> 00:04:16.125
great joy or deep grief.

73
00:04:16.125 --> 00:04:18.583
Just as spring gives way to summer

74
00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:20.250
and then the rains,

75
00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:20.875
similarly

76
00:04:20.875 --> 00:04:25.041
the seasons of your emotions
 keep changing too.

77
00:04:25.041 --> 00:04:26.750
Reflecting on this truth

78
00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.333
allows you to remain steady

79
00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:31.250
even through life’s ups and downs.

80
00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.750
I want you to practice seeing your emotions

81
00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:38.083
in this light.

82
00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:41.666
The things that frighten your heart today

83
00:04:41.666 --> 00:04:44.500
will change with time –

84
00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:47.541
just as in the universe

85
00:04:47.541 --> 00:04:51.500
night turns into day.

86
00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.000
When you understand this deeply,

87
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:58.541
even in the most stressful situations

88
00:04:58.541 --> 00:05:02.625
you begin to find peace.

89
00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:03.666
Recognizing the temporary nature

90
00:05:03.666 --> 00:05:06.083
of your experiences,

91
00:05:06.083 --> 00:05:08.666
you become free

92
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:11.208
to focus on it.

93
00:05:11.208 --> 00:05:14.958
What is eternal is

94
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:19.208
your unbreakable bond with Me.

95
00:05:19.208 --> 00:05:22.541
When you learn to look beyond the fleeting,

96
00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:25.583
then you receive that nectar

97
00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:28.166
which remains untouched

98
00:05:28.166 --> 00:05:30.500
by the flow of time.

99
00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.791
In family life,

100
00:05:36.791 --> 00:05:40.541
it’s a natural wish that our loved ones

101
00:05:40.541 --> 00:05:43.583
stay with us always.

102
00:05:43.583 --> 00:05:47.916
But that is not the reality.

103
00:05:47.916 --> 00:05:49.458
Death

104
00:05:49.458 --> 00:05:51.541
is inevitable.

105
00:05:51.541 --> 00:05:56.500
No one in this material world is eternal.

106
00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.375
Hoping that our family

107
00:05:58.375 --> 00:05:59.875
will always be together

108
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:02.666
only gives birth to heartache.

109
00:06:02.666 --> 00:06:05.291
Instead, understand

110
00:06:05.291 --> 00:06:08.750
that every soul has its own journey,

111
00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.833
and none of us

112
00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:15.791
can escape death.

113
00:06:15.791 --> 00:06:19.416
While your loved ones are still here,

114
00:06:19.416 --> 00:06:22.541
you have a precious opportunity –

115
00:06:22.541 --> 00:06:26.583
to live in such a way

116
00:06:26.583 --> 00:06:30.541
that you, and those around you, can be freed

117
00:06:30.541 --> 00:06:33.833
from this endless cycle of birth and death.

118
00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:36.250
Can be freed.

119
00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.333
Use this precious time

120
00:06:38.333 --> 00:06:40.458
to nurture your spiritual growth.

121
00:06:40.458 --> 00:06:42.416
Nurture it.

122
00:06:42.416 --> 00:06:45.041
Don’t dwell on what

123
00:06:45.041 --> 00:06:48.625
you cannot change.

124
00:06:48.625 --> 00:06:51.291
Use the time you have right now

125
00:06:51.291 --> 00:06:52.750
properly

126
00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:56.916
to develop that inner wisdom

127
00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.125
that strength

128
00:06:58.125 --> 00:07:01.041
and wisdom leads us toward liberation.

129
00:07:01.041 --> 00:07:04.208
Living this way,

130
00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:06.125
you not only yourself

131
00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:09.291
accept the unchangeable truth of death,

132
00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:11.958
but also show your family

133
00:07:11.958 --> 00:07:13.666
the path to freedom

134
00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:16.125
from this cycle of sorrow.

135
00:07:16.125 --> 00:07:20.333
You introduce them to eternal truth.

136
00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:21.083
When a family

137
00:07:21.083 --> 00:07:24.500
walks the spiritual path together,

138
00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.916
they experience an infinite joy

139
00:07:27.916 --> 00:07:30.458
that is beyond time.

140
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:39.000
Look at a flower

141
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.791
that blooms in the morning
 and wilts by evening –

142
00:07:43.791 --> 00:07:45.000
this is

143
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.375
what success in your professional life

144
00:07:48.375 --> 00:07:51.875
and failure look like.

145
00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:55.166
In your professional life, success

146
00:07:55.166 --> 00:07:59.500
and failure both are short-lived.

147
00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.708
You may stand at great heights today,

148
00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:06.666
or face obstacles tomorrow,

149
00:08:06.666 --> 00:08:10.375
but neither will last forever.

150
00:08:10.375 --> 00:08:14.000
I want you to accept wholeheartedly

151
00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.416
that this world –

152
00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:18.833
including your professional sphere –

153
00:08:18.833 --> 00:08:22.583
is in constant change.

154
00:08:22.583 --> 00:08:26.333
When you absorb this truth,

155
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:28.916
you develop a mindset of duty

156
00:08:28.916 --> 00:08:32.333
instead of attachment.

157
00:08:32.333 --> 00:08:34.625
Do your work with focus

158
00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:37.375
and dedication,

159
00:08:37.375 --> 00:08:41.541
but do not be too anxious about results.

160
00:08:41.541 --> 00:08:45.125
Success can bring joy,

161
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:48.708
and failure can bring pain,

162
00:08:48.708 --> 00:08:52.541
but both are temporary.

163
00:08:52.541 --> 00:08:55.583
Just as the moon moves sometimes to fullness

164
00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:59.541
and sometimes to darkness,

165
00:08:59.541 --> 00:09:02.041
Similarly, your professional

166
00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:05.416
life too is filled with highs and lows.

167
00:09:05.416 --> 00:09:08.750
By embracing the mindset of duty,

168
00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.541
without being swayed by outcomes,

169
00:09:11.541 --> 00:09:14.916
you learn to give your best.

170
00:09:14.916 --> 00:09:17.666
Your true action is in every

171
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:19.375
task to offer your

172
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:21.625
complete effort.

173
00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:23.000
Knowing this

174
00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.250
that the results of your work

175
00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.500
are not in your hands.

176
00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.625
When you practice this detachment,

177
00:09:30.625 --> 00:09:34.916
then you experience clarity and peace.

178
00:09:34.916 --> 00:09:37.500
You handle both achievements and challenges

179
00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.750
with wisdom.

180
00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.375
Knowing this

181
00:09:42.375 --> 00:09:48.125
that they are part of life’s unceasing flow,

182
00:09:48.125 --> 00:09:49.166
this perspective not

183
00:09:49.166 --> 00:09:52.791
only gives you stability, but

184
00:09:52.791 --> 00:09:56.583
also frees you to focus on
 the inner growth and values

185
00:09:56.583 --> 00:09:57.625
that you have woven

186
00:09:57.625 --> 00:10:00.500
into your work.

187
00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:05.166
Which you have woven into your actions.

188
00:10:05.166 --> 00:10:06.833
Remember –

189
00:10:06.833 --> 00:10:10.291
your identity is not defined by temporary gains,

190
00:10:10.291 --> 00:10:13.791
but by your unwavering

191
00:10:13.791 --> 00:10:16.583
sense of duty.

192
00:10:16.583 --> 00:10:20.291
When you act without selfish desire,

193
00:10:20.291 --> 00:10:24.583
then you reach that divine state

194
00:10:24.583 --> 00:10:27.958
where eternal peace resides.
